<title>FRANCE: Dassault remains suspended limit-down.</title>
<headline>Dassault remains suspended limit-down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dassault Aviation remained suspended limit-down and will not requote unless bids are received at 981 francs or more, a spokesman for the French stockmarkets association SBF said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock's opening was delayed by an imbalance in orders and it was suspended limit-down shortly afterwards when it dropped more than 10 percent.</p>
<p>Dassault Aviation, which risks being nationalised if the privatisation of its merger partner Aerospatiale is scuppered, is down on the parliamentary election results.</p>
</text>
